WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,130
Are you leaving?

2
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:04,980
You really just let them go like that?

3
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,580
Then why don't you go beat that person?

4
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,700
You think I'm stupid

5
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,220
Those on the ground haven't woken up yet

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,920
Even if it's quiet all the way

7
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,920
You shouldn't be able to see even a single ghost.

8
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:21,740
You also have a door lock?

9
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,260
Are you still looking for medicine?

10
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:28,190
Don't be so small that you can't open the lock if you knock it

11
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:29,710
I found a handful

12
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,310
Just in the trash can

13
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:42,620
He actually chased him to the first floor

14
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,740
you want to open the door

15
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,340
Then make a deal with me

16
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:48,370
I have what you want

17
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,260
what do you want to trade

18
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:52,820
I want you to wake up my daddy

19
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:54,500
I know he's not dead yet

20
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,620
The script of this haunted house

21
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:58,740
It’s so rich and detailed, but no one told me

22
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:01,220
How to wake up an NPC that was knocked unconscious by a cotton hammer?

23
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:02,660
how can we trust you
